Information_DEF_7="@Name can destroy completely \nwith farest shooting distance, highest shooting speed with bullets made from elixir, even smallest enemies cannot fall into your kingdom."
Information_DEF_8="Like a deadly trap, when enemies come close, no matter they fly or run, @Name appears and attack by striking lightning using high-voltage electricity."
Information_DEF_9="@Name is a rare defensive building with 2 shooting mode:\n-One target: attack 1 target with increasing power\n- Multi-targets: attack different targets at the same time with certain power"
