Information_ARM_9="They are not only legend, these scary creatures use heated fire to burn down every place they fly over\nIt's worth to pay high cost to own them!"
Information_ARM_10="Like an armor moving haughtily in the battle, with huge size like Giants, @Name can break all buildings\nNo one knows where they were born, the only thing they know is that being made mostly from iron, they attract electrical rays."
